# A schematic Zulrah's Shrine for replays. Not the real map: Boss Pilot finds a boss by its NPC
# name near the player, and supplies and gear by item name.
#
# Facts (oldschool.runescape.wiki): Zulrah is combat level 725 (w/Zulrah); a shark heals 20
# (w/Shark); a prayer potion has 4 doses (w/Prayer_potion). The worn blowpipe's id is
# ItemID.TOXIC_BLOWPIPE_LOADED (12926, "Toxic blowpipe") and Ava's assembler ItemID.AVAS_ASSEMBLER
# (22109), and Zulrah NpcID.SNAKEBOSS_BOSS_RANGED (2042), in RuneLite's gameval. Item and NPC names are the game's.

